  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PADEO Systems Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon has been struggling amidst a web of economic and political crises that rapidly worsened since late 2019 and led to raging unemployment and hyperinflation. Lebanon&#x2019;s limited internal production capacity and focus on the services sector resulted in a major trade deficit and heavy reliance on imports for products.This project serves to map, analyse and identify Lebanon&#x2019;s main productive sectors and subsequently deep dive into one specific production system to identify leverage points that should be addressed to unlock new jobs and economic growth in Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
